      <Placemark>
        <name>Ben Amera</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR6gOx_QGc4RU0CdzSeU5yVnMxGW-h2DS3NTdzAC3wFztrl7GcqG8D__aSG1MKCHmCx9Q7rew_mlkFbuf2QFl80SWDG5rkpzpucy8TGC5FeuqNW24i64NSdQ-x84tliqMFHt4mF7AyHZlK8N4JTlvBYRHv0HGv1nTQgZAoU8BvQgKs3OzbguXypGFj4vTq_fsFS2eAdFLJ2C5kF5GEqyC7DNuBChUfb7ofHvpTeRS316I2CudgiT_XKyDJ0?fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Monolito y vivac; tramo remoto junto al eje ferroviario. Acceso solo con track reciente, autonomía y criterio local.<br>Enlace: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=21.230030%2C-13.664371<br>Fotografía: Les3corbiers · CC BY-SA 3.0<br>Fuente: https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ben_Amira_2006.jpg]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1502-F9A825</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="gx_media_links">
            <value>https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR6gOx_QGc4RU0CdzSeU5yVnMxGW-h2DS3NTdzAC3wFztrl7GcqG8D__aSG1MKCHmCx9Q7rew_mlkFbuf2QFl80SWDG5rkpzpucy8TGC5FeuqNW24i64NSdQ-x84tliqMFHt4mF7AyHZlK8N4JTlvBYRHv0HGv1nTQgZAoU8BvQgKs3OzbguXypGFj4vTq_fsFS2eAdFLJ2C5kF5GEqyC7DNuBChUfb7ofHvpTeRS316I2CudgiT_XKyDJ0?fife=s16383</value>
